WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:04.350
-[Caine]: [upbeat] Welcome to the
Amazing Digital Circus Awards Show...

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:05.390
[flatly]
Charity Auction.

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:08.090
[Southern accent] We are so blessed
to have your wonderful faces here today

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:09.700
for this little hootenanny of ours!

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:12.230
The Awards Show ended up
going over budget,

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:13.580
would you believe,
and we need to make back

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.070
them lost trillion smackeroonies!

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.270
-[Pomni]: Wait, did money become a thing?
-[Caine]: Pomni, look at me!

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:19.760
Bubble!
-[Faux Bubble]: Mmyep?

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:21.300
-[Caine]: What do we have first
on the menu, boy?

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:22.450
-[Faux Bubble]: I'm Bubble.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:23.890
-[Ragatha]: W-Wait, is that me?

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:25.700
-[Caine]: You bet
your sweet sea bisket it is!

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:28.530
With this one of a kind --
I say, ONE OF A KIND keychain,

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:30.920
you're sure to get heads spinnin'
with this dangling doofus!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.340
Now, shall we start the biddin'
at 1,000 Loonies?

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:34.460
Do I hear 1,000 Loonies?

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:35.650
How about 1,000 Toonies?

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:38.240
[unintelligible rapid speech]
Sold to the ragdoll down in front!

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:40.590
-[Ragatha]: But I didn't --
-[Faux Bubble]: No refunds, [BOINK!]

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:42.230
-[Caine]: Bubble, why you sound
like a complete fool?

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:43.710
[teeth chattering]

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:46.020
Holy hotdog, Bubble,
I'm seein' four!

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:48.130
-[Bubble]: That's my cousin --
La Buble.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:50.330
-[Faux Bubble]: The "L" is silent.
-[Caine]: Whaddya mean there are two --

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:52.440
Am I hearing two
Bubbles to Bubbles?

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:53.950
Hmm...
[whispering unintelligibly]

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:56.170
-The Amazing Digital Circus.

00:00:56.190 --> 00:00:57.530
-[Bubble]: I don't give a [HONK!]

00:00:57.550 --> 00:00:59.740
-[Caine]: [clears throat]
The Bubble plush!

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:00.270
-[Faux Bubble]: Wait, wha--

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:03.140
-[Caine]: Why not spice up your life
with this little fella!

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:06.240
He's squishy, soft, and with a tongue
that's full of diseases!

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:09.080
How could anyone resist that?
I say, how could anyone resist that?

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:10.630
I got nothin'.

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:11.660
Nothin' over here,
nothin' over there.

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:14.040
[rapid unintelligible speech]
[tragic music plays]

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:16.170
-[Evil Pomni]:
Ugh, [HONK!], man.

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:18.070
This is so lame.

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:19.370
Hey, dental plan.

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:22.340
I'd like to buy this bad [BOINK!]-boy
if you're selling him.

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:25.690
-[Jax]: [laughs] Oh, you.
-[Evil Jax]: I-I'd buy Pomni over here...

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:28.100
To protect me from him.

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:30.200
-[Evil Pomni]: Why do you have to be
so [SWOOSH!] stupid?

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:31.620
-[Evil Jax]: Please stop yelling at me...
-[Kinger]: [backwards speech]

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.560
-[Kinger]: [backwards speech]

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:34.590
-[Caine]: The Machine...

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:36.840
-[The Machine]: I'm the MaMa!

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:39.280
-[Jax-Pomni]:
[chuckles] Hey.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:41.230
'Sup, losers?

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:43.540
-[Caine]: A creation gone wrong,
or horribly right!

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:45.810
The rare combination
of stoner and fool,

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:48.560
an absolute complete menace
to themselves.

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:50.000
-[Jax-Pomni]:
Who the [BOINK] is this guy?

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:51.590
-[Evil Jax]: Oh, God!
[shrieks]

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:52.940
-[Jax-Pomni]: Come on.

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:56.710
I just wanna, like,
not hurt you, or anything.

00:01:57.830 --> 00:02:00.610
I don't see a name on it,
so it's mine now.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:04.270
-[Caine]: Oh,
this isn't working, Bubble.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:06.620
We need... the MODEL...

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:09.010
[thudding footsteps approaching]

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:11.630
[sinister music plays]

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:17.760
♪♪

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:19.210
-[deep voice] Hey, guys.
-[Faux Bubble]: Now you and your --

00:02:19.230 --> 00:02:20.570
-[Caine]: Away with you, imposter!
[pop!]

00:02:20.590 --> 00:02:22.970
Show your dominance
by wearing these "I can fix him"

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.890
or "I can make her worse" shirts!

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:27.430
Featuring everyone's favorite
mentally ill duo!

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:28.820
-[Faux Bubble]:
Or, if you're a Canadian freak...

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:30.370
-[Caine]: Wait --
-[Faux Bubble]: Why not this comfy sweater

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:32.290
with all your favorite [BLEEP!]
on the back!

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:33.340
-[Caine]: And why stop there?

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:35.210
Wear in mourning
your abstracted friends

00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:38.300
on the worst body part
God ever made -- the ear.

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:39.620
Kinger, you're a fascist!

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:41.380
Would you like
a new set of glamorous --

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:42.800
-[Kinger]: Well, I --
-[Caine]: [rapid unintelligible speech]

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:44.970
-[Kinger]: Oh,
this is exciting, isn't it?

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:45.610
-[Disappearing Guy]:
I'll buy your --

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:49.410
-[Caine]: Do you like to work hard,
or do you like to hardly work it?

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:51.860
This one of a kind,
one-size-fits-all gamin' mat

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:54.360
is sure to spice up
your hardly workin'.

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:55.500
Do I --
[chaos]

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:56.450
[slowed speech]
Hootenanny --

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:58.300
Sold to the man without a shirt!

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:00.240
Wait, where da mat go?
-[Jax-Pomni]: No!

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:02.140
You [BOING!] suck, man.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:06.010
Yeah, I'm pulling your IP address
as we speak -- dick.

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:08.480
-[Caine]: [huffs] I'm on the verge
of losing my mind, Bubble.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.900
How are we doing so far?
How much did we make back?

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:13.110
-[Bubble]: Doing basic math,
judging by all the items sold,

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:16.170
I'd say we made
a grand total of zero.

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:18.040
-[Faux Bubble]: The circus is saved!

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:19.050
[off-key music plays]

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:21.150
-[Kinger]:
Oh, are we at an auction?

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:24.080
-[Evil Jax]: [weakly]
Stop, this is embarrassing...

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:25.240
-[Jax-Pomni]: Laugh out loud.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.840
-[Caine]: Oh, boy,
here come the demons!

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:31.750
-[Gangle]: What's that?
-[Zooble]: I don't know.

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:34.870
But I love how it shakes.

00:03:34.890 --> 00:03:37.730
-[Kinger]: Yeah --
and it looks like Caine, too.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:40.430
I want one.
-[Manager Gangle]: Yeah -- me, too!

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:42.030
I can put that on my pencil case,

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:44.990
or my pantzzzzzzz...

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:46.960
-[Jax-Pomni]:
Go on and keep shaking!

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:48.680
-[all]: Shake, shake, shake!

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:49.750
-[Caine]: Go on and shake me!

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:50.940
Go on and shake me!!

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.540
GO ON AND SHAKE MEEEEEEE--

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:55.400
[babbling]
[brief backwards speech]

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:57.400
-Um, is this guy gonna be okay?

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:59.930
Should we --
We should call an ambulance.

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:01.560
This is bad.

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:04.560
-[Caine]: [babbling continues throughout]

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:06.840
[cheerful western music plays]

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:13.870
♪♪

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:17.830
♪♪

